{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly, fight, and survive in this high-octane VR narrative shooter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <i>free demo</i> of <strong>The Phoenix Gene</strong>, a virtual reality experience that will get your body moving and your heart pounding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice controlling Firestorm, a time-traveling phoenix in your hands. Shoot down enemies as you fly through the dystopian city of Twin Flames protecting Jackie, a genetically enhanced janitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across dimensions through the Slipstream multiverse to kick off the quest to stop a mega-corp\u2019s immortality serum, getting a taste of the rich sci-fi story that awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move to the upbeat soundtrack by legendary composer <strong>Grant Kirkhope</strong>. Amplify the immersion with the <strong>bHaptics TactSuit</strong>, <strong>TactSleeve</strong> and <strong>TactVisor</strong> to feel every explosion and hit in your bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight and unleash your firepower in this free demo of <strong>The Phoenix Gene</strong>, an action shooter with an epic story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supports Meta Air/Link and Virtual Desktop. For Virtual Desktop, set Aim Angle Horizontal to +15 in Comfort Settings for the most natural aim.</i></p>","background":"http