/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice controlling Firestorm, a time-traveling phoenix in your hands. Shoot down enemies as you fly through the dystopian city of Twin Flames protecting Jackie, a genetically enhanced janitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across dimensions through the Slipstream multiverse to kick off the quest to stop a mega-corp\u2019s immortality serum, getting a taste of the rich sci-fi story that awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move to the upbeat soundtrack by legendary composer <strong>Grant Kirkhope</strong>. Amplify the immersion with the <strong>bHaptics TactSuit</strong>, <strong>TactSleeve</strong> and <strong>TactVisor</strong> to feel every explosion and hit in your bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.poster.avif?t=1759256682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.webm?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.mp4?t=1759256682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight and unleash your firepower in this free demo of <strong>The Phoenix Gene</strong>, an action shooter with an epic story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supports Meta Air/Link and Virtual Desktop. For Virtual Desktop, set Aim Angle Horizontal to +15 in Comfort Settings for the most natural aim.</i></p>","developers":["HEROmation"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2246040","name":"The Phoenix Gene VR"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961490/a359bc5e605b4ddc5d87e686cd29b123d2522874/header.jpg?t=1759256682","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"The Phoenix Gene | Copyright HEROmation 2025 | Trademark HEROmation 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961490/473273940/96